#: src/development.md:35
msgid ""
"The stores build everything at runtime in an empty score document: for each "
"node a device and a chain of processes ending in a _hub_, and score cables "
"between hubs for the connections. Every change goes through score's command "
"stack, which gives undo and redo."
msgstr "Les stores construisent tout à l'exécution dans un document score vide : pour chaque nœud, un périphérique et une chaîne de processus terminée par un _hub_, et des câbles score entre les hubs pour les connexions. Chaque changement passe par la pile de commandes de score, qui fournit l'annulation et le rétablissement."

#: src/development.md:40
msgid "Adding a node type"
msgstr "Ajouter un type de nœud"

#: src/development.md:42
msgid ""
"Add a file to `qml/Scenic/Nodes/`; the catalog loads every file there. A "
"type is a `NodeType`:"
msgstr "Ajoutez un fichier dans `qml/Scenic/Nodes/` ; le catalogue charge tous les fichiers de ce dossier. Un type est un `NodeType` :"

#: src/development.md:45
msgid ""
"```qml\n"
"import Scenic\n"
"\n"
"NodeType {\n"
"    kind: \"mydevice\"                       // stable id, saved in "
"sessions\n"
"    label: Translations.t(\"My Device\")\n"
"    role: \"source\"; mediaType: \"video\"; category: \"Video In\"\n"
"    protocol: Uuids.gstreamer              // the score device behind it\n"
"    fields: [\n"
"        { key: \"port\", label: Translations.t(\"Port\"), type: \"int\", "
"def: 5000 }\n"
"    ]\n"
"    makeSettings: p => Pipelines.gstVideo(\"udpsrc port=\" + p.port + \" ! "
"… ! appsink name=video\")\n"
"    addr: name => name + \":/video\"\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/development.md:61
